---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | EMON HOSSAIN"
  description="Terms of service for emonhossain.pro and SYSmoAI services."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding: 4rem 1.5rem; max-width: 40rem;">
    <div class="eyebrow">LEGAL</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-top: 1rem;">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--brand-stone-400); font-size: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-600); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
      <p>These terms govern your use of emonhossain.pro and the services provided by EMON HOSSAIN (&quot;I&quot;, &quot;me&quot;, &quot;my&quot;).</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">1. Services</h3>
      <p>Services are described on the Services page. Each engagement is governed by a separate statement of work agreed upon before work begins.</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">2. Payment</h3>
      <p>Payment terms are specified per engagement. Payments are processed via bKash, Nagad, or bank transfer. All prices are in Bangladeshi Taka (BDT) unless otherwise stated.</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">3. Intellectual Property</h3>
      <p>Upon full payment, clients receive full ownership of the delivered systems and code. I retain the right to display delivered work in my portfolio unless otherwise agreed.</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">4. Limitation of Liability</h3>
      <p>Services are provided &quot;as is.&quot; I am not liable for damages arising from use of the delivered systems beyond the total fee paid for the specific engagement.</p>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 1rem;">5. Contact</h3>
      <p>For inquiries: <a href="mailto:contact@emonhossain.pro" style="color: var(--brand-indigo);">contact@emonhossain.pro</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>